# HP39gs stock launch through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# The stock ROM mounts the host directory over Kermit, reads HP39DIR.*, then
# lazily fetches the selected aplet and library when ENTER launches it.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6

# HP39 matrix aliases:
#   G/H/I -> SYMB/PLOT/NUM
#   J/K/L -> HOME/APLET/VIEWS
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu

# HP39gs 2.22 RECEIVE FROM order:
#   HP39 (IrDA), HP39/40 (USB), HP39/40 (Ser),
#   USB Disk drive, Ser. Disk drive.
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk
13300 tap enter

# HP39DIR.CUR and HP39DIR.000 complete in roughly 30 s on the headless bridge.
31000 capture remote-aplet
32500 tap enter
34000 capture lazy-fetch
# The first ENTER above installs the remote aplet and its library, then the
# stock ROM returns to APLET LIBRARY. ENTER does not cancel an in-progress
# transfer (ON does), so retry launch after the measured full transfer window.
215000 tap enter
230000 tap enter
34500 monitor 210000
